{"Name":"Create Investigation","Description":"Create investigations for IP addresses and hostnames.","Script":"from SiemplifyDataModel import EntityTypes\nfrom SiemplifyAction import SiemplifyAction\nfrom McAfeeMvisionEDRV2Manager import McAfeeMvisionEDRV2Manager\nfrom SiemplifyUtils import output_handler, convert_dict_to_json_result_dict\nfrom ScriptResult import EXECUTION_STATE_COMPLETED, EXECUTION_STATE_FAILED\nfrom TIPCommon import extract_configuration_param, extract_action_param, construct_csv\nfrom constants import (\n    CREATE_INVESTIGATION_SCRIPT_NAME,\n    INTEGRATION_NAME,\n    DEFAULT_INVESTIGATION_NAME,\n)\nimport time\n\n\n@output_handler\ndef main():\n    siemplify = SiemplifyAction()\n    siemplify.script_name = CREATE_INVESTIGATION_SCRIPT_NAME\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(\"----------------- Main - Param Init -----------------\")\n\n    # Configuration\n    api_root = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"API Root\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n    )\n\n    iam_root = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"IAM Root\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n    )\n\n    client_id = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Client ID\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n    )\n    client_secret = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Client Secret\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n    )\n    api_key = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"API Key\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n    )\n    verify_ssl = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Verify SSL\",\n        default_value=True,\n        input_type=bool,\n    )\n\n    scopes = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Scopes\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n    )\n\n    # Parameters\n    name = extract_action_param(\n        siemplify,\n        param_name=\"Name\",\n        is_mandatory=False,\n        default_value=DEFAULT_INVESTIGATION_NAME,\n    )\n    hint = extract_action_param(siemplify, param_name=\"Hint\", is_mandatory=False)\n    priority = extract_action_param(siemplify, param_name=\"Priority\", is_mandatory=True)\n    case_type = extract_action_param(\n        siemplify, param_name=\"Case Type\", is_mandatory=True\n    )\n\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(\"----------------- Main - Started -----------------\")\n    status = EXECUTION_STATE_COMPLETED\n    result_value = True\n    successful_entities = []\n    failed_entities = []\n    json_results = {}\n    output_message = \"\"\n\n    try:\n        siemplify.LOGGER.info(\"Connecting to McAfee Mvision EDR V2.\")\n        manager = McAfeeMvisionEDRV2Manager(\n            api_root,\n            iam_root,\n            client_id,\n            client_secret,\n            api_key,\n            scopes,\n            verify_ssl,\n            siemplify.LOGGER,\n        )\n        siemplify.LOGGER.info(\"Successfully connected to McAfee Mvision EDR V2.\")\n\n        investigations = []\n\n        for entity in siemplify.target_entities:\n            try:\n                siemplify.LOGGER.info(f\"Started processing entity: {entity.identifier}\")\n\n                if entity.entity_type == EntityTypes.ADDRESS:\n                    investigation = manager.create_ip_investigation(\n                        case_priority=priority,\n                        case_type=case_type,\n                        case_name=name,\n                        case_hint=hint,\n                        address=entity.identifier,\n                    )\n\n                elif entity.entity_type == EntityTypes.HOSTNAME:\n                    investigation = manager.create_hostname_investigation(\n                        case_priority=priority,\n                        case_type=case_type,\n                        case_name=name,\n                        case_hint=hint,\n                        hostname=entity.identifier,\n                    )\n\n                else:\n                    siemplify.LOGGER.info(\n                        f\"Entity {entity.identifier} is of unsupported type. Skipping.\"\n                    )\n                    continue\n\n                investigations.append(investigation)\n\n                siemplify.LOGGER.info(\n                    f\"Created investigation {investigation.investigation_id} for entity {entity.identifier}.\"\n                )\n\n                json_results[entity.identifier] = investigation.to_json()\n                successful_entities.append(entity.identifier)\n\n                if hint:\n                    # Sleep to avoid 429 rate limit errors on evidence adding\n                    time.sleep(10)\n\n            except Exception as e:\n                failed_entities.append(entity.identifier)\n                siemplify.LOGGER.error(\n                    f\"An error occurred on entity: {entity.identifier}\"\n                )\n                siemplify.LOGGER.exception(e)\n\n            siemplify.LOGGER.info(f\"Finished processing entity: {entity.identifier}\")\n\n        if investigations:\n            siemplify.result.add_data_table(\n                title=\"Investigations\",\n                data_table=construct_csv(\n                    [investigation.to_table_data() for investigation in investigations]\n                ),\n            )\n\n        if successful_entities:\n            output_message += \"Successfully created investigation for the following entities: \\n{}\".format(\n                \"\\n\".join(successful_entities)\n            )\n\n        else:\n            output_message = \"No investigations were created.\"\n            result_value = False\n\n        if failed_entities:\n            output_message += \"\\n\\nAction was not able to create investigations for the following entities: \\n{}\\n\".format(\n                \"\\n\".join(failed_entities)\n            )\n\n    except Exception as e:\n        output_message = (\n            f\"Error executing action '{CREATE_INVESTIGATION_SCRIPT_NAME}'. Reason: {e}\"\n        )\n        siemplify.LOGGER.error(output_message)\n        siemplify.LOGGER.exception(e)\n        status = EXECUTION_STATE_FAILED\n        result_value = False\n\n    siemplify.result.add_result_json(convert_dict_to_json_result_dict(json_results))\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(\"----------------- Main - Finished -----------------\")\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(\n        f\"\\n  status: {status}\\n  result_value: {result_value}\\n  output_message: {output_message}\"\n    )\n    siemplify.end(output_message, result_value, status)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n","IntegrationIdentifier":"McAfeeMvisionEDRV2","ScriptResultName":"is_success","DynamicResultsMetadata":[{"ResultName":"JsonResult","ResultExample":"[{\"Entity\": \"1.1.1.1\", \"EntityResult\": {\"type\": \"investigations\", \"id\": \"05cae9b0-24ca-11eb-b713-000000000000\", \"attributes\": {\"created\": \"2020-11-12T09:32:46.411Z\", \"lastModified\": \"2020-11-12T09:32:46.411Z\", \"name\": \"Siemplify Test\", \"owner\": \"unknown\", \"summary\": \"\", \"source\": \"unknown\", \"isAutomatic\": true, \"hint\": \"Test\", \"caseType\": \"IOC\", \"investigated\": true, \"status\": \"In progress\", \"priority\": \"High\"}}}]","ShowResult":true}],"Creator":"Admin","IsEnabled":true,"IsCustom":true,"AiGenerated":false,"IsSystem":false,"Version":1.0,"TimeoutSeconds":300,"IsAsync":null,"AsyncPollingIntervalInSeconds":3600,"TotalIntervalTimeoutForAsyncInSeconds":86400,"Parameters":[{"CustomActionId":0,"IsMandatory":true,"DefaultValue":"IOC","Description":"Defines the type of alert.","Name":"Case Type","Value":"IOC","Type":15,"OptionalValues":["Malicious","Network","IOC"],"OptionalValuesJson":"[\"Malicious\", \"Network\", \"IOC\"]"},{"CustomActionId":0,"IsMandatory":true,"DefaultValue":"Low","Description":"Assigns a priority to the investigation.","Name":"Priority","Value":"Low","Type":15,"OptionalValues":["High","Medium","Low"],"OptionalValuesJson":"[\"High\",\"Medium\", \"Low\"]"},{"CustomActionId":0,"IsMandatory":false,"DefaultValue":"","Description":"Automatically links related investigations and avoids creating many cases from multiple alerts related to the same incident. If the same hint is used, the evidences will be added to the already existing investigation.","Name":"Hint","Value":"","Type":0,"OptionalValues":null,"OptionalValuesJson":null},{"CustomActionId":0,"IsMandatory":false,"DefaultValue":"","Description":"Gives the investigation a meaningful name. If the name is missing, a default case name is assigned.","Name":"Name","Value":"","Type":0,"OptionalValues":null,"OptionalValuesJson":null}],"DefaultResultValue":null,"PythonVersion":"None","ActionType":1,"SimulationData":{"Entities":["HOSTNAME","ADDRESS"]},"SimulationDataJson":"{\"Entities\": [\"HOSTNAME\", \"ADDRESS\"]}","AICategories":[],"AIDescription":"### General Description\nThis action creates new investigations in McAfee Mvision EDR V2 for specific entities, specifically IP addresses and hostnames. It allows security analysts to programmatically initiate guided investigations within the McAfee platform, providing metadata such as priority, case type, and naming conventions to organize the response effort.\n\n### Parameters Description\n| Parameter | Type | Mandatory | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Case Type** | String | Yes | Defines the category of the alert. Supported values include `Malware`, `Network`, and `IOC`. |\n| **Priority** | String | Yes | Assigns a severity level to the investigation. Supported values are `High`, `Medium`, and `Low`. |\n| **Hint** | String | No | A unique identifier used to automatically link related investigations. If an investigation with the same hint already exists, evidence is added to that case instead of creating a new one. |\n| **Name** | String | No | A custom name for the investigation. If left blank, a default name ('Siemplify Investigation') is used. |\n\n### Additional Notes\n- The action includes a built-in 10-second delay between processing entities when a **Hint** is provided to prevent triggering API rate limits (429 errors) on the McAfee side.\n- Supported entity types are limited to IP Addresses and Hostnames.\n\n### Flow Description\n1. **Authentication**: The action retrieves credentials (API Key, Client ID/Secret) and obtains an OAuth token from the McAfee IAM service.\n2. **Entity Filtering**: It iterates through the target entities in the Google SecOps case, filtering for `ADDRESS` (IP) and `HOSTNAME` types.\n3. **Investigation Creation**: For each valid entity, it sends a POST request to the McAfee EDR API (`/edr/v2/investigations`) containing the investigation details (name, priority, type, and the entity identifier as evidence).\n4. **Result Processing**: It captures the unique Investigation ID and metadata returned by McAfee.\n5. **Output Generation**: The action populates a data table with the investigation details and attaches the raw JSON response for each entity to the action results.","EntityTypes":["ADDRESS","HOSTNAME"]}